<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Email Verification - Anao ny Teny</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #4f46e5;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
        }
        .content {
            background-color: #f9fafb;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #4f46e5;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #6b7280;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>Welcome to Anao ny Teny!</h1>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content">
        <h2>Create Your Password</h2>
        
        <p>Hello {{ user.name ?: user.email }},</p>
        
        <p>Thank you for registering with Anao ny Teny! To complete your registration and start using our platform, please create your password by clicking the button below:</p>
        
        <a href="{{ verification_url }}" class="btn">Create Password</a>
        
        <p>Or copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>
        <p style="word-break: break-all; background-color: #e5e7eb; padding: 10px; border-radius: 4px;">{{ verification_url }}</p>
        
        <p><strong>Important:</strong> This link will expire in 24 hours for security reasons. After creating your password, your email will be automatically verified.</p>
        
        <p>If you didn't create this account, please ignore this email.</p>
        
        <p>Best regards,<br>The Anao ny Teny Team</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
        <p>This email was sent to {{ user.email }}. If you have any questions, please contact our support team.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>